    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>SHOOT FOR THE MOON is an arcade action platformer with ridiculous roguelite upgrades and a loveable cast of  fully voice-acted misfit friends!</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3516460/extras/2046d2a7415b57e937c391f6765f887a.poster.avif?t=1754737662\" width=616 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3516460/extras/2046d2a7415b57e937c391f6765f887a.webm?t=1754737662\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3516460/extras/2046d2a7415b57e937c391f6765f887a.mp4?t=1754737662\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Throw your magical spear at flying creatures as you ascend through dangerous, druid-controlled woods!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With the help of your freaky found family, you will upgrade your spear, your spells, and your monster buddy so you can grow higher and higher, venturing from forest to sky city to the belly of a dragon and beyond!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3516460/extras/b99a7e809db93e3c95af141727a98ca2.poster.avif?t=1754737662\" width=616 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3516460/extras/b99a7e809db93e3c95af141727a98ca2.webm?t=1754737662\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3516460/extras/b99a7e809db93e3c95af141727a98ca2.mp4?t=1754737662\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade your spear length and speed to become an unstoppable harpooning-hurling machine!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Uncover the terrible secrets hidden in the dark side of the woods!</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bring new friends to life to unlock unexpected skills like teleportation and mind control!</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gobble up birds, bats and beasts to ignite combos during a run and pump up your powers!</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get revenge on the evil druids who keep the forest under their thrall</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3516460/extras/182ed81ac5f48fc2524ff0cd59900278.poster.avif?t=1754737662\" width=616 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3516460/extras/182ed81ac5f48fc2524ff0cd59900278.webm?t=1754737662\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3516460/extras/182ed81ac5f48fc2524ff0cd59900278.mp4?t=1754737662\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hilariously voice-acted and addictive as hell, it's time to grab your spear and SHOOT FOR THE MOON!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you miss, just upgrade your weapons and go again!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3516460/extras/a3a00f5be3d35169ebb07b6650d36dc7.poster.avif?t=1754737662\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3516460/extras/a3a00f5be3d35169ebb07b6650d36dc7.apng?t=1754737662\" class=\"bb_img\" width=616 height=100 /></picture></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>SHOOT FOR THE MOON is an arcade action platformer with ridiculous roguelite upgrades and a loveable cast of  fully voice-acted misfit friends!</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3516460/extras/2046d2a7415b57e937c391f6765f887a.poster.avif?t=1754737662\" width=616 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3516460/extras/2046d2a7415b57e937c391f6765f887a.webm?t=1754737662\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3516460/extras/2046d2a7415b57e937c391f6765f887a.mp4?t=1754737662\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Throw your magical spear at flying creatures as you ascend through dangerous, druid-controlled woods!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With the help of your freaky found family, you will upgrade your spear, your spells, and your monster buddy so you can grow higher and higher, venturing from forest to sky city to the belly of a dragon and beyond!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3516460/extras/b99a7e809db93e3c95af141727a98ca2.poster.avif?t=1754737662\" width=616 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3516460/extras/b99a7e809db93e3c95af141727a98ca2.webm?t=1754737662\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3516460/extras/b99a7e809db93e3c95af141727a98ca2.mp4?t=1754737662\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade your spear length and speed to become an unstoppable harpooning-hurling machine!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Uncover the terrible secrets hidden in the dark side of the woods!</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bring new friends to life to unlock unexpected skills like teleportation and mind control!</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gobble up birds, bats and beasts to ignite combos during a run and pump up your powers!</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get revenge on the evil druids who keep the forest under their thrall</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3516460/extras/182ed81ac5f48fc2524ff0cd59900278.poster.avif?t=1754737662\" width=616 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3516460/extras/182ed81ac5f48fc2524ff0cd59900278.webm?t=1754737662\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3516460/extras/182ed81ac5f48fc2524ff0cd59900278.mp4?t=1754737662\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hilariously voice-acted and addictive as hell, it's time to grab your spear and SHOOT FOR THE MOON!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you miss, just upgrade your weapons and go again!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3516460/extras/a3a00f5be3d35169ebb07b6650d36dc7.poster.avif?t=1754737662\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3516460/extras/a3a00f5be3d35169ebb07b6650d36dc7.apng?t=1754737662\" class=\"bb_img\" width=616 height=100 /></picture></span></p>",
